        <p class="article__lead">A week of sun, spice and sisterhood on the Indian Ocean. Daily beachfront yoga, the spice-scented lanes of Stone Town, a traditional dhow under sail and long barefoot days — shared with a small circle of like-minded women and a Rendile hostess throughout.</p>
        <p>Gentle and restorative rather than rushed: come to slow down, reconnect and breathe. Solo travellers, mother-and-daughter pairs and groups of friends are all warmly welcome.</p>
