      <div class="days">
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 1</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Karibu Zanzibar</h3><p>Met at the airport and taken into historic Stone Town. Settle into a boutique hotel, then gather for a welcome dinner of Swahili mezze as the call to prayer drifts over the rooftops.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Stone Town boutique hotel · <b>Meals:</b> Dinner</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 2</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Stone Town &amp; the spice route</h3><p>A guided walk through the UNESCO old town — carved doors, the market and the Old Fort. In the afternoon, a spice-farm visit and a hands-on Swahili cooking class.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Stone Town boutique hotel · <b>Meals:</b> Breakfast, lunch</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 3</div><div class="day__body"><h3>North to the coast</h3><p>Drive to the powder-white beaches of the north. Settle into your beachfront retreat, then ease into the week with a sunset yoga session on the sand.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Beachfront resort · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 4</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Yoga, ocean &amp; rest</h3><p>Morning yoga and meditation, then the day is yours — swim, read, or snorkel the reef. An optional spa treatment and a moonlit beach dinner close the day.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Beachfront resort · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 5</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Dhow sailing &amp; a sandbank picnic</h3><p>Board a traditional dhow for a day on the turquoise water — snorkelling, a barefoot sandbank picnic and a slow sail home into the sunset.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Beachfront resort · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 6</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Jozani forest &amp; a closing circle</h3><p>An optional morning at Jozani to meet the rare red colobus monkeys, then a restorative afternoon — final yoga, journaling and a celebratory farewell feast.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Beachfront resort · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 7</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Farewell to the island</h3><p>A last sunrise stretch on the beach, then transfer to the airport for your onward flight — rested, restored and already planning the next.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Meals:</b> Breakfast</p></div></div>
